  Helm is called the package manager for Kubernetes.
It helps you install, manage, upgrade, and configure Kubernetes applications easily.
Why Helm is used
-> Without Helm, you manually create many YAML files:
    Deployment
    Service
    ConfigMap
    Ingress
    Secrets
    PVC
    etc.
Helm combines all these into a reusable package called a Chart.

to install tools
to deploy application 
to maintain manifest files and helpful for update easily

